 "title": "Wandering · A5 · 3 Giant Lizards (CR 1/4 each) · Moderate, 150 XP · cleared",
 "headline": "A natural 20 on Sleep caught all three lizards, and Morten picked them apart for 3 HP of damage.",
 "prose": [],
 "bullets": [
  {
   "label": "Cheese",
   "text": "Sleep at 12 sq rolled a natural 20, so its radius doubled to 3 m and caught all three. Only Lizard A failed, and it went down unconscious in round 1."
  },
  {
   "label": "The dice",
   "text": "Thunderwave fizzled in round 3, and the Heroic Inspiration reroll saved it. Magic Missile fizzled in round 5 and is lost for the day. Shield turned the one bite that would have hurt."
  },
  {
   "label": "How it ended",
   "text": "Thunderwave and Magic Missile wore down the two awake lizards; then he walked up to the sleeper and fired Scorching Ray point-blank. The first ray auto-crit for 13 dmg and the second finished it."
  },
  {
   "label": "Result",
   "text": "17/20 HP, Magic Missile lost, Heroic Inspiration used. XP 1,275 → 1,425. +15 GP."
  }
 ],
